<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to repay Paris Club $538 million next week.</title>
<headline>Brazil to repay Paris Club $538 million next week.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil will pay the Paris Club group of nations $538.2 million in debt obligations next week, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>In a statement the bank said it would pay the Paris Club $245.56 million in principal and $292.64 million in interest payments on June 30 and July 1.</p>
<p>The statement did not say how much total debt Brazil had with the Paris Club.</p>
<p>((--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414)</p>
